# Title: Gpscript Execution
# ID: 1e59c230-6670-45bf-83b0-98903780607e
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-05-16
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218
# Description: Detects the execution of the LOLBIN gpscript, which executes logon or startup scripts configured in Group Policy
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((CommandLine CONTAINS " /logon" OR CommandLine CONTAINS " /startup")) AND ((Image="*\\gpscript.exe") OR (OriginalFileName == "GPSCRIPT.EXE"))) AND NOT ((ParentCommandLine == "C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe -k netsvcs -p -s gpsvc")))
